All the questions we pretend to answer with our project

Researched Questions:

-Is there a relationship between the volume of goods handled in ports and
the economic performance of Portugal, Italy and the Netherlands?

-How did port activity evolve in 2015–2025, and how deep and how long were the effects of COVID-19 (2020)?

-Which economy depends most on maritime transport?

-How did the inflow and outflow of goods through the ports of Portugal, the Netherlands, and Italy evolve between 2015 and 2024?
